{
  "short_id": "short306",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-072-lacmegantic",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.282,
  "total_seconds": 52.67,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-072-lacmegantic\\06_voice\\master\\short306_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Shortly before midnight, in a village called Nantes, somebody looked at a parked locomotive and saw flames on the front of it.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.362,
      "seconds": 6.362,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:46b2a30b3dab9896647a388db2c257a824f25665685f8c6d1c5121bbf1747b7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The firefighters who arrived did exactly what they were trained to do, and they did it correctly. The fire went out.",
      "start": 6.582,
      "end": 12.805,
      "seconds": 6.223,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:64654717908ee3cf27cc4042450f7d34c3e50a445921aa807d97347da336a4ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "What nobody in that yard knew was that the engine they were about to switch off was the only thing holding seventy-two tank cars of crude oil above a sleeping town.",
      "start": 13.025,
      "end": 21.338,
      "seconds": 8.313,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:3ae29ac130f07ce019a7ad3bc507c0476b3b3be790406dffd1eb2470aa37744f"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "No decision was documented, after the fire was extinguished, to move the train or to apply additional hand brakes. No decision.",
      "start": 21.558,
      "end": 28.988,
      "seconds": 7.43,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:e19da2078e2e252402a26735a2fcfebb4f5c33b4acc068c5a1b5378fb17fcbc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "The pressure holding a ten-thousand-ton train on a descending grade fell, slowly, for about an hour and a half.",
      "start": 29.208,
      "end": 35.245,
      "seconds": 6.037,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:ef24985f3c75dfe9c51d3a9da71d757013cce24f2cc341802fcb26dffb333172"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "At fifty-eight minutes past midnight and twenty-one seconds, the train began to move. One mile an hour. There was no person.",
      "start": 35.465,
      "end": 42.617,
      "seconds": 7.152,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0d6b6042980a58aa04fc7726908e588563c9a17f14411090a6ecf9a137b2e8be"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Seventeen minutes later it was doing sixty-five miles an hour.",
      "start": 42.837,
      "end": 46.088,
      "seconds": 3.251,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:a45035da84b15200cafc6775b8ddf5d182e4a72543d655395a86da8a8302506f"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Seven point two miles of descending grade, no driver, no brake that was coming back, and a town at the bottom.",
      "start": 46.308,
      "end": 52.67,
      "seconds": 6.362,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:bca92e4bd0fb1863bb9eb72ad6a55d78273e60ca9e98808d0947a31e91d74a69"
    }
  ]
}
